# Cloudflare Pages headers for cookbot.noahfreelove.com.
#
# This is a fully static, zero-JavaScript page (hand-written HTML + one external
# stylesheet + an SVG favicon), so the CSP can be tight: no scripts at all, and
# every resource must come from our own origin. There is no build step that copies
# this file, so it must live directly inside the served directory (public/), unlike
# the SvelteKit adapter convention where _headers sits at the project root.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: microphone=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), interest-cohort=()
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
